From: XR1710G AP project
Subject: [PATCH] mt7996: opt-in MTK automatic PP vendor command/event bridge

Adapt Allen Ye/Howard Hsu MTK08196fa6 PP command0xcc/event5 and MCU0x38/0x5a
to current be5ce791. Validate NLA/TLV/bitmap/band, resolve VIF links under the
driver mutex, use ACK before committing mode, and preserve one-bitmap-per-band.
No default enablement, no firmware blob replacement, no RF acceptance claim.
Inherit BSD-3-Clause-Clear. STA/extender PP remains separately unqualified.

